&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#04a5e5">print&lt;/span>(x)&lt;span style="color:#9ca0b0;font-style:italic">#如果轮到x&amp;#39;进，但是x没用过，输出&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> used[i]&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#fe640b">True&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> path&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>append(x)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> dfs()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> used[i]&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">=&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#fe640b">False&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> path&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>pop()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> nums&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">.&lt;/span>sort()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> dfs()
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">return&lt;/span> res
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>全排列需要一个数组来记录某个元素是否在 path上被用过。
